  "bodyHash": "KglnO3cZ9Dg=",
  "content": "<div>\n<h1><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>✨ 紅石優化包</strong></span></h1>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/jMhlv0AnTmg?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></span><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">紅石優化包是一款保留原版風格的資源包，旨在提升你的紅石體驗。它讓多種隱藏的方塊狀態可見，在物品欄添加實用圖表等功能！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>🛠️ 自訂功能</strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">本資源包現已完整支援<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252frespackopts\" rel=\"nofollow\">ResPackOpts</a>模組，可自由開關功能並調整各項細節。我的YouTube頻道上有<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fyoutu.be%252fiJObRPuR6Bs\" rel=\"nofollow\">教學影片</a>詳細說明所有設定！</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>❤️ 喜歡這個資源包？</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">我投入大量熱情製作紅石優化包，若您將它用於線上內容（YouTube影片、Twitch直播等），請在描述中標註出處，這將是對我最大的支持。</span><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"> 支援格式建議：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">使用資源包：RexxStone製作的紅石優化包</span><br><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fredstone-tweaks%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://modrinth.com/resourcepack/redstone-tweaks/</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h2><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif\"><strong>🙏🏻 致謝名單</strong></span></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">紅石優化包是項龐大工程！過程中參考了許多創作者的紋理、模型與方塊狀態文件，特別感謝：</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fvanillatweaks.net%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vanilla Tweaks</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fbeatso%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Beatso</a> (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252flittle-improvements-redstone%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">紅石小改良</a>)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252fmember%252fcreativity_shark%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">CreativityShark</a> (<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252fvisual-sensors%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">視覺感測器</a>)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@metamilo\" rel=\"nofollow\">metamilo</a></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fKikuGie\" rel=\"nofollow\">KikuGie</a> (初始ResPackOpts設定)</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">基礎紋理來自Mojang Studios</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">特別感謝Discord管理員Junq協助製作部分紋理！</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><span style=\"font-family:helvetica, arial, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">更多紋理與模型來源資訊，請參閱資源包內的「credits.txt」文件。</span></p>\n</div>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
